+# Secure conversion: LogicMath
+
+## Source, authority and scope
+
+Upstream https://github.com/silveroxides/ComfyUI-LogicMath at exact
+`102d49201d488084a0978fc39dd5742a09475a88`, release `x102d492`.
+Registry release 0.1.1 has nine exact retained/Git/codeload files. The pinned
+archive SHA256 is `c9940d6d6f37d3b0d021d8604a983e6c7a9a41a96452ff4aa7c4976af9218050`.
+Its actual root name is preserved. Git/retained 0644 modes are authoritative;
+raw tar 0664 packaging is documented, not permission to alter captured modes.
+MIT copyright silveroxides 2026 and bundled math-icon.png remain byte-exact.
+Historical retained priority is not a current download/trending claim.
+
+Census: 28 actual V3 extension exports, zero frontend extensions, JS-only nodes
+or routes. Complete pristine and V2 trees are captured. The original async
+ComfyExtension entrypoint/export order remains; explicit mappings describe the
+same 28 classes for secure manifest discovery, not additional IDs.
+
+## Exact backend disposition proposal
+
+| Exact ID | Disposition | Evidence scope |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| MathAdd | supported | Literal ordered fold, guarded intermediate integer growth. |
+| MathSubtract | supported | Literal ordered fold and direct empty/short errors. |
+| MathMultiply | supported | Literal ordered fold, before-compute bit growth. |
+| MathDivide | supported | Both zero policies and native validation/error text. |
+| MathPower | supported | Native complex, zero/negative branches and projected growth. |
+| MathFloor | supported | Native integer output, complex/nonfinite domain errors. |
+| MathCeil | supported | Native integer output and errors. |
